:"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/17/Aniplex"},{"mal_id":53,"name":"Dentsu","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/53/Dentsu"},{"mal_id":1365,"name":"Shueisha","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/1365/Shueisha"},{"mal_id":1392,"name":"Zack Promotion","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/1392/Zack_Promotion"}],"rank":66,"rating":"R - 17+ (violence & profanity)","score":8.7,"scored_by":214550,"season":"summer","source":"Manga","status":"Finished Airing","studios":[{"mal_id":1,"name":"Studio Pierrot","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/1/Studio_Pierrot"}],"synopsis":"After a brutal surprise attack by the forces of Quincy King Yhwach, the resident Reapers of the Soul Society lick their wounds and mourn their losses. Many of the surviving Soul Reaper captains train to battle without their Bankai, the ultimate technique wielded by the fiercest warriors.\n\nIn the previous assault, Ichigo Kurosaki narrowly managed to help fend off Yhwach's fearsome wrath. However, to ultimately defeat his godly adversary and save his allies, Ichigo must now undergo severe training that will push him beyond his physical, emotional, and mental limits.\n\nThough Yhwach already holds the upper hand in this ongoing blood feud, he also successfully recruits Uryuu Ishida, Ichigo's close friend and rival, to be his successor. Yhwach strikes out once again at the weakened Soul Society, intent on finally obliterating his long-standing enemies. As Ichigo struggles to attain new power, the Soul Reaper captains fight for survival and borrowed time.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","themes":[],"title":"Bleach: Sennen Kessen-hen - Ketsubetsu-tan","title_english":"Bleach: Thousand-Year Blood War - The Separation","title_japanese":"BLEACH 千年血戦篇-訣別譚-","title_synonyms":["Bleach: Thousand-Year Blood War Arc Part 2"],"titles":[{"title":"Bleach: Sennen Kessen-hen - Ketsubetsu-tan","type":"Default"},{"title":"Bleach: Thousand-Year Blood War Arc Part 2","type":"Synonym"},{"title":"BLEACH 千年血戦篇-訣別譚-","type":"Japanese"},{"title":"Bleach: Thousand-Year Blood War - The Separation","type":"English"}],"trailer":{"embed_url":"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/m_i2PinZ_X4?enablejsapi=1&wmode=opaque&autoplay=1","images":{"image_url":null,"large_image_url":null,"maximum_image_url":null,"medium_image_url":null,"small_image_url":null},"url":null,"youtube_id":null},"type":"TV","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/53998/Bleach__Sennen_Kessen-hen_-_Ketsubetsu-tan","year":2023},{"aired":{"from":"2006-12-16T00:00:00+00:00","prop":{"from":"[Object]","to":"[Object]"},"string":"Dec 16, 2006","to":null},"airing":false,"approved":true,"background":"Bleach Movie 1: Memories of Nobody was licensed by VIZ Media. The film had a limited theatrical release in 2008 in the United States and Canada, followed by the DVD release in October. Moreover, a light novel adaptation was published earlier in Japan in December 2006.","broadcast":{"day":null,"string":null,"time":null,"timezone":null},"demographics":[{"mal_id":27,"name":"Shounen","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/genre/27/Shounen"}],"duration":"1 hr 32 min","episodes":1,"explicit_genres":[],"favorites":672,"genres":[{"mal_id":1,"name":"Action","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/genre/1/Action"},{"mal_id":2,"name":"Adventure","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/genre/2/Adventure"},{"mal_id":37,"name":"Supernatural","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/genre/37/Supernatural"}],"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1834/134488.jpg","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1834/134488l.jpg","small_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1834/134488t.jpg"},"webp":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1834/134488.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1834/134488l.webp","small_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1834/134488t.webp"}},"licensors":[{"mal_id":119,"name":"VIZ Media","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/119/VIZ_Media"}],"mal_id":1686,"members":296925,"popularity":912,"producers":[{"mal_id":16,"name":"TV Tokyo","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/16/TV_Tokyo"},{"mal_id":53,"name":"Dentsu","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/53/Dentsu"},{"mal_id":1365,"name":"Shueisha","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/1365/Shueisha"}],"rank":2321,"rating":"PG-13 - Teens 13 or older","score":7.43,"scored_by":181328,"season":null,"source":"Manga","status":"Finished Airing","studios":[{"mal_id":1,"name":"Studio Pierrot","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/1/Studio_Pierrot"}],"synopsis":"When a life ends, its soul departs to its final resting place known as the Soul Society. However, if a soul is left to wander in the human world for too long, it ends up turning into a corrupted \"Hollow\" that feeds on other souls. In such cases, spirits called \"Soul Reapers\" are needed to eliminate the Hollows and guide the lost souls to the Soul Society.\n\nIchigo Kurosaki and Rukia Kuchiki are two Soul Reapers who are used to dealing with Hollows that appear in Karakura Town. But when they encounter the hostile \"Blanks\"—souls devoid of memories and immune to the \"soul burial\" used by Reapers—they are thrown for a loop. Senna, a fellow Reaper that neither Ichigo or Rukia are familiar with, comes to their rescue and manages to fend off the Blanks. The mystery deepens when a mirage of the human world suddenly appears over Soul Society. What could be the reason behind the strange phenomena, and how is it connected to Senna, who avoids any questions about her identity?\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","themes":[],"title":"Bleach Movie 1: Memories of Nobody","title_english":"Bleach the Movie: Memories of Nobody","titl