},"licensors":[{"mal_id":119,"name":"VIZ Media","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/119/VIZ_Media"}],"mal_id":2889,"members":262012,"popularity":1042,"producers":[{"mal_id":1365,"name":"Shueisha","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/1365/Shueisha"}],"rank":2334,"rating":"PG-13 - Teens 13 or older","score":7.42,"scored_by":155118,"season":null,"source":"Manga","status":"Finished Airing","studios":[{"mal_id":1,"name":"Studio Pierrot","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/1/Studio_Pierrot"}],"synopsis":"Assigned to protect a royal procession transporting a powerful artifact called the \"Ouin,\" Squad 10 gathers in the human world as Captain Toushirou Hitsugaya and Lieutenant Rangiku Matsumoto observe the area cautiously. However, the caravan is suddenly struck by a group of assailants who wreak havoc on the procession, stealing the Ouin in the process. After a brief clash with one of the attackers, the distraught Hitsugaya pursues the escaping thieves, leaving behind Matsumoto and the disoriented squad. Following the incident, the Seireitei brands Hitsugaya a traitor for abandoning his post and puts Squad 10 on indefinite lockdown.\n\nIn the human world, Ichigo Kurosaki is investigating a spiritual abnormality when he stumbles across the injured Captain, but is caught off guard when Hitsugaya suddenly flees. Soon learning of the situation, Ichigo, Rukia Kuchiki, Renji Abarai, and Matsumoto set off to prove Hitsugaya's innocence and uncover the truth behind the theft of the Ouin. Meanwhile, a ghost from Hitsugaya's past haunts his thoughts as he chases down the true culprit.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","themes":[],"title":"Bleach Movie 2: The DiamondDust Rebellion - Mou Hitotsu no Hyourinmaru","title_english":"Bleach the Movie: The DiamondDust Rebellion","title_japanese":"劇場版 BLEACH The DiamondDust Rebellion もう一つの氷輪丸","title_synonyms":[],"titles":[{"title":"Bleach Movie 2: The DiamondDust Rebellion - Mou Hitotsu no Hyourinmaru","type":"Default"},{"title":"劇場版 BLEACH The DiamondDust Rebellion もう一つの氷輪丸","type":"Japanese"},{"title":"Bleach the Movie: The DiamondDust Rebellion","type":"English"},{"title":"Bleach Film 2: The Diamond Dust Rebellion","type":"German"},{"title":"Bleach Film 2: The Diamond Dust Rebellion","type":"French"}],"trailer":{"embed_url":"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Nl1rdgDbnBY?enablejsapi=1&wmode=opaque&autoplay=1","images":{"image_url":null,"large_image_url":null,"maximum_image_url":null,"medium_image_url":null,"small_image_url":null},"url":null,"youtube_id":null},"type":"Movie","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/2889/Bleach_Movie_2__The_DiamondDust_Rebellion_-_Mou_Hitotsu_no_Hyourinmaru","year":null},{"aired":{"from":"2008-12-13T00:00:00+00:00","prop":{"from":"[Object]","to":"[Object]"},"string":"Dec 13, 2008","to":null},"airing":false,"approved":true,"background":"","broadcast":{"day":null,"string":null,"time":null,"timezone":null},"demographics":[{"mal_id":27,"name":"Shounen","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/genre/27/Shounen"}],"duration":"1 hr 33 min","episodes":1,"explicit_genres":[],"favorites":548,"genres":[{"mal_id":1,"name":"Action","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/genre/1/Action"},{"mal_id":2,"name":"Adventure","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/genre/2/Adventure"},{"mal_id":37,"name":"Supernatural","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/genre/37/Supernatural"}],"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1633/134491.jpg","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1633/134491l.jpg","small_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1633/134491t.jpg"},"webp":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1633/134491.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1633/134491l.webp","small_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1633/134491t.webp"}},"licensors":[{"mal_id":119,"name":"VIZ Media","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/119/VIZ_Media"}],"mal_id":4835,"members":249477,"popularity":1085,"producers":[],"rank":2030,"rating":"PG-13 - Teens 13 or older","score":7.5,"scored_by":145248,"season":null,"source":"Manga","status":"Finished Airing","studios":[{"mal_id":1,"name":"Studio Pierrot","type":"anime","url":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/producer/1/Studio_Pierrot"}],"synopsis":"After a mysterious pair attack Rukia Kuchiki and erase her memories while she is in Seireitei, Ichigo Kurosaki, a substitute Soul Reaper, briefly forgets Rukia, until he is reminded of her by Kon, an Underpod Mod-Soul. Confused, he seeks his town's candy-shop owner, Kisuke Urahara, who opens the pathway to Seireitei for them. Ichigo is then shocked to find that his allies in Seireitei, the Shinigami of the Soul Society, have forgotten him.\n\nFilled with action, Kimi no Na wo Yobu follows Ichigo and Kon as they fight against their former comrades while searching for the missing Rukia and discovering her assailants before they strike again.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","themes":[],"title":"Bleach Movie 3: Fade to Black - Kimi no Na wo Yobu","title_english":"Bleach the Movie: Fade to Black","title_japanese":"劇場版 BLEACH Fade to Black 君の名を呼ぶ","title_synonyms":["Fade to Black: Call Out Your Name"],"titles":[{"title":"Bleach Movie 3: Fade to Black - Kimi no Na wo Yobu","type":"Default"},{"title":"Fade to Black: Call Out Your Name","type":"Synonym"},{"title":"劇場版 BLEACH Fade to Black 君の名を呼ぶ","type":"Japanese"},{"title":"Bleach the Movie: Fade to Black","type":"English"},{"title":"Bleach Film 3: Fade To Black","type":"German"},{"title":"Bleach Film 3: Fade to Black","type":"French"}],"trailer":{"embed_url":"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/-DGfE_47nGs?enablejsapi=1&wmode=opaque&autoplay=1","images":{"image_url":null,"large_image_url":null,"maximum_image_url":null,"medium_image_url":null,"small_image_url":null},"url":null,"you